{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：16:00 2026-10-29 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明細佬罕曝光  半工讀極叻仔理大一級榮譽畢業  Felix五官唔似大佬結婚10年\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3ed5c96a989f3489125ccf35f0d7c9c9/2026-10/Copy_of_KF__131.png\"/>\n<p>47歲的TVB「金牌司儀」陸浩明，近日在社交平台激罕大晒家庭照，原來陸浩明的胞弟陸浩輝（Felix）學業有成，在香港理工大學以極優異的一級榮譽成績畢業，陸浩明難掩興奮與自豪之情，除了分享弟弟身穿畢業袍、頭戴四方帽的英姿外，更大方公開兩兄弟珍貴的童年合照，並溫馨發文寫道：「恭喜細佬，讀咗幾年終於畢業啦」，隔空為弟弟送上真摯祝賀。</p>\n<h2>陸浩明晒兄弟童年照</h2>\n<p>在陸浩明分享的童年舊照與畢業片段中，兩兄弟並肩而立，小時候的模樣精靈可愛，手足情深不言而喻。不過網民除了替Felix感到高興外，焦點更火速落在兩兄弟的外貌對比上。網民發現Felix的五官輪廓、溫文笑容與眉宇神態，簡直與陸媽媽猶如「餅印」一樣，反觀哥哥陸浩明雖然同樣戴上眼鏡，散發文質彬彬的書生氣息，但二人外型特徵卻「唔多似樣」。</p>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明與圈外女友陳詩欣拍拖14年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/84b978ffe14fc75d3bf62a7be22f79a6/2022-11/unknown_278960136_332390412322633_7641291988595567788_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明（6號）與網紅女友陳詩欣（Ayan）好恩愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf54b4584bd54dba461f9c544dccf5ab/2024-09/ayanbubi_1671856853_3000075184123450193_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明與女友陳詩欣沙灘漫步，充滿粉紅色泡泡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3c9cc142947ab881f6a13c2c8301c65f/2024-09/Photo_shared_by_on_September_14_2024_tagging_lukhoo_and_ay6style_May_be_an_image_of_2_people_sundress_beach_twilight_and_ocean_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明早前無預警宣佈結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ded685b08173d0bd3674d7c4d1b1c178/2026-08/lukhoo_2026_8_28_3973455676189246316_708533.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明胞弟Felix穿上理大畢業袍戴上四方帽，神態斯文，外貌較像媽媽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/45cb5411f59375dff125294e2baf4538/2026-10/SaveClip_App_876396802_18643841455004534_1133718736035348320_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明罕有公開與細佬的童年溫馨合照，可見兩兄弟自幼已感情要好、手足情深。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7c8d0f9e67d30db6bf20f5d0aa52e9f4/2026-10/SaveClip_App_868919124_18643841446004534_6364519236564839835_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明與女友結束14年長跑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eb6fe84570a2e57c17f01aa4ee20ee0d/2026-08/lukhoo_2026_8_28_3973455710330847683_708533.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明貼出多張馬爾代夫求婚的照片並說：「Yeah！ 我求婚成功。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e425acbed7efcd29b2215595b297c659/2026-08/lukhoo_2026_8_28_3973455725313024787_708533.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣晒婚戒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ff116cf327a3847ea16ab25f6ce2b28b/2026-08/lukhoo_2026_8_28_3973455744472590899_708533.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明和女友去馬爾代夫旅行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f491dfad13d444a8e9e93155d63155e4/2026-08/lukhoo_2026_8_28_3973455749757394679_708533.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明說：「 我會用一萬倍嘅努力，讓妳幸福快樂。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9dffa535175bcbe4c059b6b23a658e79/2026-08/lukhoo_2026_8_28_3973455770972247298_708533.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣不時派福利照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a47550df952759a32ac3b11583966f1b/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682601302_3090206156763980965_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣同時亦是一名KOL。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/372f30b611fd50d8be8e12456a0473cc/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682601302_3090206156772393542_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣常晒身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/80aa4ccd22941036635ca7783c40f3de/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682601302_3090206156772562092_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣外形不輸明星。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dd81da9672d0ba4e04507b5fec99af88/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682601302_3090206156831166103_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣常晒身材吸Like。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/326c40bb6387911eb3daaaed83031641/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682601302_3090206156847934510_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣樣子甜美。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a3c26f4bce25493b41d7da0d17190aa9/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682945619_3093094498144885192_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明和女友陳詩欣屢傳婚訊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cc611acafa570b2b284547b4dd108095/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682945619_3093094498144969906_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣愛晒泳照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/789e3af8fc9a86dd447c6c9f9d5e22be/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682945619_3093094498153480753_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<h2>陸浩明已婚弟弟半工讀畢業</h2>\n<p>陸浩明弟弟早於2016年成家立室，而陸浩明更發文大讚弟弟「一邊返工一邊返學，成功畢業」，比起陸浩明當年畢業於香港城市大學工業工程與工程管理學系，當時以三級榮譽畢業，如今細佬Felix青出於藍，取得理大的一級榮譽學位，引得網民笑稱細佬成功幫陸家「光宗耀祖」、「替阿哥爭返啖氣」。</p>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明由有線過檔TVB後，工作不斷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a1efeddf351ad8b7a255fd55984a675e/2022-11/11282002_600.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"當年「有線幫」過檔TVB，有好多發展機會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c3996fcd850a6f90b6a8b892b2cae8c/2022-11/316701776_1261985307982505_2037463008822602660_n_600.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明與肥媽合作，更上契成為契母子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/38434b5315a5994aa0855ae6ed20f3b8/2022-11/GQET2r4O6OTgoDOl_Yo9PkwGDFv13tXeelLoIHpS6CA.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明與肥媽拍節目有很好多火花。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/154fcefd048cbec833f4ba631026b3a7/2022-11/VideoScreenshot--YouTube--0%E2%80%9903%E2%80%9D_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"除了拍節目，近年亦拍過《智能愛人》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be7e340a13f2e5100c3966ff79960027/2022-11/11282001_600.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"做大騷主持。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/57f049eb59006fe8bcef7c4831412a08/2022-11/unknown_258740198_4785697591483872_5850706624893454850_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明媽媽外表後生，相貌慈祥。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc3f4f48a573e2a9c989c3f5a55411b2/2025-08/b_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明送名牌給媽媽做生日禮物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9f6040ec00ca1d5fd74deb87b112c9dc/2025-08/c_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸媽媽有花有蛋糕仲有禮物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f9778c8b8b8e6bcdc970fb7b4ad13860/2025-08/d_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸媽媽十分和藹可親。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/82cda2736d57a30a6277d0d2654b96ba/2025-08/e_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明的弟弟亦罕有現身為媽媽慶生。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e19e6a7802541d49f3a1107ac6ee61ae/2025-08/f_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明的弟弟於2016年已經結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/578f58ef8ef35e308fd6feabfead18d8/2025-08/VV.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明的弟弟2016年結婚，當時拍下全家福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ea0ef2923fd2bd93a6ecd330ff4b8887/2025-08/VV3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明早前與陳詩欣飛台灣墾丁過二人世界。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/45024b35eb4215324cdd049f85b2f658/2024-09/Photo_by_on_September_21_2024_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_sarong_pool_and_outdoors_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明早前與陳詩欣飛台灣墾丁過二人世界。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5a8db0f1a30c0237e32351b88de93c37/2024-09/VS--VillaHeagrandmaskentingInstagram-0_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣亦換上多套款式的水著，陸續在IG上分享性感靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/31710b2bbb693bf27812c1b1170b7297/2024-09/Photo_by_on_September_21_2024_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_and_bra_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣換上泳裝，大晒長腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e9c4a733ea72e18403e7d096255f9134/2024-09/Photo_by_on_September_21_2024_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_pool_cabana_and_outdoors_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣在IG上大派粉絲福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/326e804c205340cbc70edad53b65a382/2024-09/Photo_by_on_September_15_2024_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_and_bra_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣大派福利，身材惹火。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5797d4b1ec2855bb0735a37cbf90ca2e/2024-09/Photo_by_on_September_15_2024_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_bra_and_pool_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣在IG上大派粉絲福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/94c39c2428e5347b02089bfb19d2020f/2024-09/Photo_by_on_September_15_2024_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_bra_and_pool_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男友視角甜蜜蜜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83611694dc86453dbc2ff27c294e8c5b/2024-09/Photo_by_on_September_14_2024_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_sundress_dress_beach_cloud_and_twilight_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣墾丁谷胸大解放露豐滿上圍！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2c876846e001cff6d598318a73a6d887/2024-09/Photo_shared_by_6_on_September_15_2024_tagging_ayanbubi_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_sarong_pool_and_outdoors_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"不過有不少網民放錯重點，留意到陸浩明的褲浪位稍微隆起。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f960d75ce7730b89a408f215ec7529c5/2024-09/Photo_by_6_on_September_15_2024_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_sarong_and_pool_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明早前無預警宣布求婚成功。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6bfff4b28c6f2e5e2d66e878477633b9/2024-09/Photo_by_6_on_September_15_2024_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_sarong_and_pool_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣拍靚相留倩影。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7293788206a419ac257df3ac0516875b/2023-12/ayanbubi_1621061578_2573973534189385965_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣拍靚相留倩影。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/70cbd611eb29e28cda837b153e19162f/2023-12/ayanbubi_1635434637_2694543496298990356_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣拍靚相留倩影。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7edb32cf6ee931e3ac001c8c8ebaca19/2023-12/ayanbubi_1672317417_3003938675674636942_1047905.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T09:02:09.105939+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":517,"images":47,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T08:00:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T10:58:47.936098+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T08:58:40.858901+00:00","content_hash":"f427cca16a09e7989b6f20128c7c5fc72fe376c6384bb5b37b87fabfb70bf48b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}